        <item>
            <title>3.23.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 09:42:28 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>217</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.23.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- **New Session Without Folder** (File menu, ⌘⇧N): start a session for a quick question without choosing a project folder first. The launcher's folder menu also lists *No folder* at the top.
- **Move a session to another folder**: ask a session to move to a project folder and it continues there with its conversation intact. A folder Claude has not trusted yet asks for confirmation first, and nothing moves if you cancel or leave the alert unanswered.
- **Open a found session**: after Claude finds a past session for you, it can open it. An open session is brought forward, a closed one opens in a new pane, and one on your other Mac opens as a mirror pane.

### Changes
- Removed the automatic session recap that appeared above the input after Canopy sat in the background for 3 minutes, along with its Settings toggle. Recaps Canopy added to existing sessions stay hidden when you reopen them.
]]></description>
